// Elemental Forge, the owner's rework of G09 Elemental Attunement (docs/DECKS_ROUND8.md C.7): a
// building whose element is chosen when it is built, fire (Fire mana) or lightning (Air mana): two
// buildings that exclude each other in a city. Units trained there strike with the element (their
// physical attack deals it: the target's resistance to it cuts their attack) and are immune to it.
