    "TXT_KEY_TECH_CARD_ELEMENTAL_FORGE": "Elemental Forge",
    "TXT_KEY_TECH_CARD_ELEMENTAL_FORGE_HELP": "[ICON_BULLET]Allows the Elemental Forge, built as a Fire Forge (needs Fire mana) or a Storm Forge (needs Air mana); a city has one or the other.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Units trained in a Fire Forge's city: their physical attack deals fire damage (the target's fire resistance cuts it) and they are immune to fire.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Units trained in a Storm Forge's city: the same with lightning.",
